	(gr_text "FAB STACKUP: JLC06161H-3313; 35um outer / 15.2um inner. Standard through vias 0.60/0.30 mm; two approved J401 data vias 0.50/0.20 mm. No via-in-pad or HDI. USB impedance is calculated, not measured. NOT RELEASED FOR FABRICATION."
